# End-to-End DevOps Project (Terraform + Ansible + Jenkins)

## 🚀 Overview
This project demonstrates a complete DevOps pipeline:
- Provision infrastructure using Terraform
- Configure servers using Ansible
- Deploy CI/CD pipeline using Jenkins

## 🛠 Tools Used
- AWS (EC2)
- Terraform
- Ansible
- Jenkins
- Docker

## ⚙️ What I Did
- Created infrastructure as code using Terraform
- Automated configuration with Ansible
- Built Jenkins pipeline for deployment

## 📈 Result
Fully automated deployment pipeline from infrastructure to application.